            {
              "text": "Angus Comyns is a Canberra screen print and stencil artist, working on canvas, on walls, and on most things in between. The work is loud and layered. He needed a personal brand that could sit next to it without getting flattened."
            }
          ],
          "type": "p",
          "id": "L47qItz1NZ"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "xiZqSBkRD_",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "In collaboration with "
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Pat Rose"
                }
              ],
              "type": "a",
              "url": "https://rickrose.com.au/",
              "id": "yt_gAkak48"
            },
            {
              "text": " under the Oddjobs banner, I covered the lot: logo and brand identity, a custom website with an online store, and a photography set of Angus himself plus proper documentation of the finished pieces."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "ib3j9q3iPs",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "We also filmed him working. On-location video following Angus through new pieces, cut into short documentary edits so people could see how the work actually gets made."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "gfQ0nkXKWB",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Then two catalogues: one for print, one built for a touchscreen."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
